From 28159d1e477a1d95fead951e9a47f8373b8ba56f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Captain Polliwog build <build@captainpolliwog.invalid>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 17:27:51 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 37/53] Regular expressions: named capture groups, Unicode
 property escapes

- (?<name>...), \k<name>, match.groups, $<name> in replacement strings,
  and the groups argument to replace functions (ES2018). Lookbehind,
  (?<= and (?<!, is still unsupported.
- \p{...} and \P{...} in /u patterns (ES2018): General_Category,
  Script, Script_Extensions and binary properties, with their sets
  taken from ICU when the pattern is compiled.
